# AI Usage Log

## Purpose

This file records how AI tools were used during the development
of the AI Study Assistant project.

## AI Usage

### 1. Project Planning
AI was used to generate and refine the initial project idea,
product vision, MVP scope, and development roadmap.

### 2. Documentation
AI was used to help prepare the README.md and ROADMAP.md files.

### 3. Development Support
AI may be used to explain programming concepts, identify errors,
and suggest possible implementation approaches.

### 4. Testing Support
AI may be used to suggest test cases and acceptance criteria.

## Important Note

AI-generated suggestions are reviewed and tested by the development
team before being included in the final project.
